<title>JAPAN: Nishikawa Rubber -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Nishikawa Rubber -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 52.18		vs	   48.19</p>
<p> Operating	    2.40		vs	    1.77</p>
<p> Current		2.45		vs	    1.90</p>
<p> Net		    1.53		vs	  815    million</p>
